'''Traveller '''is a [[Godly Weapons|godly]] [[:Category:Pets|pet]] that was originally obtainable by purchasing the [[Halloween Item Pack]] for 1,299 Robux during the [[Halloween Event 2017|2017 Halloween Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended. 
== Trivia ==
* Its model derives from the now offsale Roblox bundle [https://www.roblox.com/bundles/35/Pumpkingeist Pumpkingeist].
*It partners with the godly knife [[BattleAxe]], making the '''Halloween 2017 set.''' 

